DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9098::$$$message_0066_0000_0000$$$::It's the schoolyard in the afternoon.[lr]::
9099::$$$message_0066_0000_0001$$$::It must be downtime, as there are no club activities going on.[lr]::
9100::$$$message_0066_0000_0002$$$::As I'm gazing at the quiet schoolyard, I feel like I see a familiar back from afar.[lr]::
9101::$$$message_0066_0000_0003$$$::"No... That's..."::
9102::$$$message_0066_0001_0000$$$::I catch up to them.[lr]::
9103::$$$message_0066_0001_0001$$$::"Huh? No, it really is her."[lr]::
9104::$$$message_0066_0001_0002$$$::I thought I was seeing things, but it's Rider after all.::
9105::$$$message_0066_0002_0000$$$::"Hey, Rider."[lr]::
9106::$$$message_0066_0002_0001$$$::"...Oh, Shirou."[lr]::
9107::$$$message_0066_0002_0002$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]I call after her and walk on the dry grass.[lr]::
9108::$$$message_0066_0002_0003$$$::My footsteps are noisy, so Rider probably would've noticed even if I had approached quietly.::
9109::$$$message_0066_0003_0000$$$::"It's rare for you to come to the school on a weekend."[lr]::
9110::$$$message_0066_0003_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
9111::$$$message_0066_0003_0002$$$::"Do you have business with Sakura?"[lr]::
9112::$$$message_0066_0003_0003$$$::When Rider comes to school, it often has to do with Sakura.[lr]::
9113::$$$message_0066_0003_0004$$$::Rider has no business if it isn't about Sakura.::
9114::$$$message_0066_0004_0000$$$::"Yes, however, I have already finished my business with Sakura. I was just waiting around here."[lr]::
9115::$$$message_0066_0004_0001$$$::"At such a lonesome place? Wouldn't you feel better out front?"[lr]::
9116::$$$message_0066_0004_0002$$$::"It would cause Sakura trouble if I were loitering around the archery range or places that would attract people's attention."::
9117::$$$message_0066_0005_0000$$$::I see, so that's the reason.[lr]::
9118::$$$message_0066_0005_0001$$$::But... It's not good to be waiting for Sakura forever in a place like this.[lr]::
9119::$$$message_0066_0005_0002$$$::It would be good if Rider could go inside the archery range, but... Hmm, I wonder if there's a way to get outsiders into the range...::
9120::$$$message_0066_0006_0000$$$::"Oh, yeah. Do you want to try shooting a bow, Rider?"[lr]::
9121::$$$message_0066_0006_0001$$$::"Me? [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服04g(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=ライダー私服04g(中) time=300 textoff=0]I am not good with projectiles, but..."::
9122::$$$message_0066_0007_0000$$$::Is it because her class is Rider?[lr]::
9123::$$$message_0066_0007_0001$$$::But depending on the hero, there are some who have a varied ability that corresponds to multiple classes.[lr]::
9124::$$$message_0066_0007_0002$$$::I look at Rider up and down.[lr]::
9125::$$$message_0066_0007_0003$$$::She's strong and has a taste for martial arts, so I think it would be good to start kyudo.::
9126::$$$message_0066_0008_0000$$$::"...You seem like you would have a good aptitude, and I would think that Sakura would be happy to teach you a lot of things. That way, it won't be weird for you to be at the archery range either."[lr]::
9127::$$$message_0066_0008_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01a(中)]Rider teaches Sakura magecraft, but it'd be nice for her to be the one being taught at times. It should be motivating for Sakura too.::
9128::$$$message_0066_0009_0000$$$::"...Will you teach me then?"[lr]::
9129::$$$message_0066_0009_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
9130::$$$message_0066_0009_0002$$$::"You're Sakura's teacher, right?[lr]::
9131::$$$message_0066_0009_0003$$$::The secret to improvement when learning the arts is to learn from the best."[lr]::
9132::$$$message_0066_0009_0004$$$::"N-No, that's a bit troubling."::
9133::$$$message_0066_0010_0000$$$::A private lesson with Rider sounds tempting, but because it's so tempting, there's a problem.::
9134::$$$message_0066_0011_0000$$$::"See, the captain of the kyudo club is Sakura, and she's pretty good at teaching. I can shoot arrows, but I'm bad at instructing[line len=3]"[lr]::
9135::$$$message_0066_0011_0001$$$::"Is that really the case?[lr]::
9136::$$$message_0066_0011_0002$$$::You do lack words. However, it is thanks to you that Sakura was able to acquire the skills to make such wonderful food."::
9137::$$$message_0066_0012_0000$$$::"I appreciate you saying that, but...you see, Sakura will also be happy if you start learning how to shoot a bow, and it's not good for me to intrude."::
9138::$$$message_0066_0013_0000$$$::"I see... [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服04g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=800][chgfg storage=ライダー私服04g(中) time=300 textoff=0]Then, I shall discuss with Sakura next time.[lr]::
9139::$$$message_0066_0013_0001$$$::Sakura told me to cook, but I think I am more cut out for the bow."::
9140::$$$message_0066_0014_0000$$$::"Oh. Um, it might be better to learn both at the same time..."[lr]::
9141::$$$message_0066_0014_0001$$$::"No. I am not skillful enough to be able to improve at two things at once.[lr]::
9142::$$$message_0066_0014_0002$$$::I will tell Sakura that you said to learn the bow rather than cooking."::
9143::$$$message_0066_0015_0000$$$::"Oof..."[lr]::
9144::$$$message_0066_0015_0001$$$::...That was literally stirring up a hornet's nest... Oh well, I'll think of how to follow up on this later...[lr]::
9145::$$$message_0066_0015_0002$$$::"Also, another way for you to be at Homurahara without it being weird is... How about becoming a transfer student?"::
9146::$$$message_0066_0016_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=800][chgfg storage=ライダー私服04e(中) time=300][say storage=sch0336_rad_0100 name=ライダー]No, I do not think that is realistic.[lr]::
9147::$$$message_0066_0016_0001$$$::Maybe if it were Saber, but I could not possibly look good in those uniforms."[lr]::
9148::$$$message_0066_0016_0002$$$::That kind of dress-up would be fun too, but... Wait, hold on.[lr]::
9149::$$$message_0066_0016_0003$$$::The Homurahara uniforms aren't the only costumes here.::
9150::$$$message_0066_0017_0000$$$::"That's right, Rider. You should become the school nurse."[lr]::
9151::$$$message_0066_0017_0001$$$::"Pardon?"[lr]::
9152::$$$message_0066_0017_0002$$$::"The nurse's office teacher. You'd look good in a white coat, Rider."::
9153::$$$message_0066_0018_0000$$$::If Rider became the school nurse...[lr]::
9154::$$$message_0066_0018_0001$$$::I bet there would be a long line at the nurse's office. The boys would go insane if there was such a beautiful school nurse.[lr]::
9155::$$$message_0066_0018_0002$$$::Rider wearing a white coat on top of that tight-fitting costume, crossing her legs.[lr]::
9156::$$$message_0066_0018_0003$$$::Yeah, it's perfect.::
9157::$$$message_0066_0019_0000$$$::"...Shirou. Unfortunately, I do not have the qualifications.[lr]::
9158::$$$message_0066_0019_0001$$$::On top of that, it is out of character for me to teach people things. I do not think it fundamentally fits me."[lr]::
9159::$$$message_0066_0019_0002$$$::Rider gives me a cold, sidelong glance.[lr]::
9160::$$$message_0066_0019_0003$$$::That's it. Perfect beyond perfect.[lr]::
9161::$$$message_0066_0019_0004$$$::She has natural talent for being a nurse, and the title of Ultimate Woman Doctor is far from simply being a dream.::
9162::$$$message_0066_0020_0000$$$::"...Wait, no, no. That's not it.[lr]::
9163::$$$message_0066_0020_0001$$$::Rider. Even Fuji-nee has a teaching degree in English. I think you being a school nurse is a lot more convincing."[lr]::
9164::$$$message_0066_0020_0002$$$::Although it's not like you can get a degree from looks alone.[lr]::
9165::$$$message_0066_0020_0003$$$::I think Rider being in the nurse's office is a pretty good idea, considering it was just off the top of my head.::
9166::$$$message_0066_0021_0000$$$::"...It's difficult after all, huh?"[lr]::
9167::$$$message_0066_0021_0001$$$::"Yes, I am worried about Sakura, but we must both have constraints being together twenty-four seven.[lr]::
9168::$$$message_0066_0021_0002$$$::She should live freely away from the world of magecraft when at school."::
9169::$$$message_0066_0022_0000$$$::[clfg pos=all textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=300]Rider starts walking, stepping on the crunchy fallen leaves. There's no need to prolong the conversation any longer in a forest like this.::
9170::$$$message_0066_0023_0000$$$::"Then I will go take a bit of a walk. I am also curious about the nurse's office that you were talking about."[lr]::
9171::$$$message_0066_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah. I don't think anyone is there since it's a weekend, but it'd be nice if you took an interest in it."[lr]::
9172::$$$message_0066_0023_0002$$$::"...I shall give it some thought.[lr]::
9173::$$$message_0066_0023_0003$$$::I will see you later then. I will be waiting at the gate, so let us go home with Sakura."::
9174::$$$message_0066_0024_0000$$$::[clfg pos=all textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=300]Rider says, as she leaves.[lr]::
9175::$$$message_0066_0024_0001$$$::...Maybe I'll go to the student council room and kill some time...::

